    "chunk_text": "alfe, bind on Wi\u00fe f\u00e6r swile nim hunan, gebeat & gemeng wi\u00fe rysele, lege on. Eft mare twynihte, grut mealtes, smedma, cersan, \u00e6ges \u00fe\u00e6t hwite, bisceopwyrt, elene, ontre, Wi\u00fe deadum swile nim grundeswelgean, lege on gleda & gewyrme & lege \u00feonne swa wearme on Wi\u00f0 deadum swile, agrimonian gebeat, meng wi\u00f0 win & wi\u00fe sealt, do on \u00feone swile, sona gewit Wi\u00fe swile, attorla\u00f0an gecnuwa, lege on \u00feone swile, lege l\u00e6st on \u00fe\u00e6t dolh self. Drenc wi\u00fe deadum swile \u00fe\u00e6t he utslea, eofor\u00ferote, eolone, gotwo\u00f0e, twa wenwyrta do on ealu Wi\u00fe deadum swile genim swanewyrt, gecnuwa wel, gemeng wi\u00f0 ferscre buteran, lege on \u00feone Wi\u00fe swile, cunille, spring wyrt, clate wyl on buteran & on hunige, lege on \u00fea wyrta, gemeng wi\u00f0 Swe\u00feing wi\u00fe swile, ban wyrt ufewearde gecnuwa sm\u00e6le, \u00fea wyrte gemeng wi\u00f0 \u00e6ges \u00fe\u00e6t hwite, Wyrc \u00fe\u00e6t b\u00e6\u00fe of \u00feam ilcum wyrtum on cealdum wylle w\u00e6tre, gecnuwa \u00fea wyrta swi\u00fee wel, lege Wi\u00f0 swile cnuwa ni\u00f0ewearde hamor wyrt & secg, bind on. L\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe bl\u00e6ce & b\u00e6\u00fe, fiftyne ealra. Wel eolenan ni\u00feewearde & mintan on sealtes rynian \u00fe\u00e6t hit sie \u00feicce swa briw, gemeng tog\u00e6dere, Wi\u00fe bl\u00e6ce nim eolonan ni\u00fe",
